      "side": 1,
      "message": "Overarching questions for my understanding...Thank you for taking the time to explain.\n\nAre these properties only relevant for Dawn? From what I can tell, for Vulkan and Metal, the default cases you set seem to be the case. So do these have utility for any other backends besides Dawn? \n\nIn Ganesh, I see we had `dmsaaResolveCanBeUsedAsTextureInSameRenderPass` - is there a reason we deviated slightly from that approach and instead now use multiple flags?",
