      "lineNbr": 168,
      "author": {
        "id": 19434
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-31T04:58:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nevertheless, I suppose we don\u0027t use native swapchain\u0027s textures that much. In chrome, we don\u0027t use native swapchains at all AFAIK. Swapchains seem to be only used by skia tools (`viewer` etc) atm. And for those tools, I don\u0027t see any instances of copying textures to swapchain nor \"MSAA load from resolve\" feature being used. Hence maybe I could just remove this flag and instead add an `SkASSERT` when only texture view is exposed for a texture.",
